  - Android
  - performance
  - benchmarking
  - reproducibility
abstract: >-
  RNArchBench is an open benchmark and replication suite for evaluating
  performance trade-offs between React Native Legacy Architecture, React Native
  New Architecture, and native Android. It includes benchmark applications,
  frozen canonical and provenance datasets, reproducible analysis scripts,
  publication-figure generation, and utilities for prospective replication.
